# PowerShell scripts were moved to internal-tools/ on 2026-07-28 so
# .assetsignore (line 35) excludes them. The rules below use the
# `404!` (force) flag so they OVERRIDE any matching static file — CF
# Pages normally serves static files ahead of _redirects, which means
# an old or stale .ps1 at the root could still leak via the CDN cache
# (observed 2026-07-28: pre-deploy-check.ps1 still 200-OK at
# weddingai.video/pre-deploy-check.ps1 even after the file was
# removed from the deploy root). The `!` forces the rule to win.
/*.ps1                            /404                            404!
/*.psm1                           /404                            404!
/*.psd1                           /404                            404!
/internal-tools                   /404                            404!
/internal-tools/*                 /404                            404!
/qa                              /404                            404
/qa/*                            /404                            404
/tmp                             /404                            404
/tmp/*                           /404                            404
/indexnow-key.txt                /404                            404
/.github                         /404                            404
/.github/*                       /404                            404
/netlify.toml                    /404                            404

